# ==========================================
# Vodafone Netherlands (Loon 纯净规则集格式)
# ==========================================

# --- [1] 荷兰 ePDG 标准 3GPP 域名 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, mnc004.mcc204.pub.3gppnetwork.org

# --- [2] 荷兰本地业务域名 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, vodafone.nl

# --- [3] 荷兰专属定向发现服务器 ---
DOMAIN, v-hds-nle.vodafone.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, entitlement.vodafone.com

# --- [4] 荷兰核心网段 (不解析 IP 直接路由) ---
IP-CIDR, 139.7.0.0/16, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 82.216.0.0/16, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 109.32.0.0/13, no-resolve
IP-CIDR,109.39.144.148/13, no-resolve

# --- [5] IPsec 端口逻辑组合规则 ---
AND,((DEST-PORT,500),(PROTOCOL,UDP))
AND,((DEST-PORT,4500),(PROTOCOL,UDP))
